      "prompt": "Every run, delete all Hermes sessions whose preview/title line does NOT contain the exact marker [Fatal7x]. Keep sessions that do contain [Fatal7x].\n\nDo this non-interactively and safely:\n1) Run: hermes sessions list --limit 1000\n2) Parse session IDs from the rightmost ID column (pattern like YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_hex).\n3) For each session line, if the line does not contain [Fatal7x], delete it with: hermes sessions delete --yes <ID>\n4) Print a concise summary: kept count, deleted count, and deleted IDs.\n5) Verify by running hermes sessions list --limit 1000 and print the final remaining table.\n\nIf no deletions are needed, print 'No sessions deleted; all matched keep rule.'",
